DESCRIPTION:The Men of My 20s is a reflective comedy about the men\, mistak
 es\, and moments that shaped a decade. Emmi Abel-Rutter explores the idea t
 hat everyone has a recurring thread running through their life. For some it
 's grief. For others it's illness\, family\, or failure. For her\, it’s m
 en. This is a show about love\, identity\, and remaining a hopeful romantic
 \, even when her twenties gave her 49 reasons not to be.\nMore info: https:
